{
  "title": "Fail fast on missing game configuration and remove dead metadata \
resolver",
  "description": "Config.load_config silently returns when no default \
configuration is found or when config_file does not exist. The fallback list \
references configs/dumb.json, which is not present, so invoking the CLI \
without --config can leave an empty Config and fail later through unrelated \
assertions. Require a real configuration path and raise a clear error naming \
the attempted path before compilation or process startup. Decide on one valid \
CLI default or make --config required; do not silently continue with an empty \
configuration. While cleaning this area, remove Config.resolve_deck_metadata, \
which has no callers and duplicates deck parsing and registry lookup code. Add \
tests for an omitted config, a missing explicit path, and the selected valid \
default behavior.",
  "status": "open",
  "priority": 2,
  "type": "bug",
  "labels": [
    "configuration",
    "cleanup",
    "fail-fast",
  ],
